commit c059c57fb55c2051a02f8d396955ec26020cf172
Author: yanjustino <contact@yanjustino.com>
Date:   Tue Sep 29 08:37:52 2026 -0300

    feat: enhance prompts and schemas to support system evolution tracking
    
    - Updated prompts for attributes, brief, and requirements to clarify handling of existing systems and new requests.
    - Added 'mudanca' field to quality, constraint, and compliance schemas to classify changes as 'novo', 'modificado', 'as_is', or 'removido'.
    - Enhanced ingest schema to include 'natureza' classification for sources, distinguishing between current systems and new requests.
    - Modified RawExtract tool to support additional plain text file formats for better source ingestion.
    - Improved WikiHtmlExport and WikiIndex tools to display 'natureza' information in the generated HTML.
    - Introduced continuity tracking in WorkItem actions to indicate evolution from existing systems.
    - Added telemetry client for sending telemetry data based on configuration settings.

